OL,3,GNEWSAWhistleblower 'ignored' by surgeon
OL,4,AIan Paterson
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor who helped blow the whistle on
OL,7,Fthe jailed surgeon Ian Paterson
OL,8,Fdescribed being ignored by him and
OL,9,Fbeing told he "didn't want anyone
OL,10,Frocking the boat".
OL,12,FHemant Ingle was appointed in late 2006
OL,13,Fas a consultant breast surgeon at
OL,14,FSolihull Hospital, where Paterson
OL,15,Falready worked.
OL,17,FInquests into the deaths of 70 patients
OL,18,Ftreated by Ian Paterson are being
OL,19,Fheard, to establish whether or not any
OL,20,Fof them died an unnatural death as a
OL,21,Fresult of his care and treatment.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
